div.p:
Desiring to assure the independence of the States of Vietnam, Laos and Cambodia
                    which are now subject to armed attack and invasion by forces which serve
                    international Communism;

Convinced that the situation calls for their exercise in this area of the
                    inherent right of collective self-defense recognized by Article 51 of the
                    Charter of the United Nations;

list.item:
That if the lands of any of them in the Southeast Asia and Western Pacific
                        area fell under the domination of international Communism that would be a
                        threat to the peace and security of them all;
